Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:11.27,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Diante do desespero absoluto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:15.27,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:21.82,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:26.62,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:29.88,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.50,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:37.75,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:42.05,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:47.72,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.93,0:01:52.95,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:55.44,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:02:00.86,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:03.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:09.21,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.59,0:02:12.62,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:16.45,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:18.48,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Até encontrar
